  "originalQuery": "You are migrating a monolithic application to a microservices architecture on Google Cloud Platform (GCP). The application uses a relational database. As part of the migration process, you need to assess application and database dependencies. Which of the following methods should you use to ensure a comprehensive assessment?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Assess dependencies only between the microservices, as the database will remain unchanged during the migration.<br/>B. Use Cloud Data Fusion to map dependencies between the application and database.<br/>C. Analyze the application code, database schema, and SQL queries to identify dependencies, and break down the monolithic application into microservices accordingly.<br/>D. Migrate the entire application and database to GCP, and then use Cloud Logging to analyze dependencies.",
  "domain": "Migrate data solutions",
