  "qid": "27",
  "tip": "<p>When a question asks how to map application to database dependencies prefer answers that combine <i>static</i> code and schema review with <i>runtime</i> observation of production SQL. Look for comprehensive methods done before migration rather than tool only shortcuts.</p>",
